WEBVTT

00:08.067 --> 00:09.533
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.533 --> 00:11.333
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:11.333 --> 00:12.800
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.800 --> 00:14.600
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:14.600 --> 00:17.633
- * OHH...
-*哦...

00:17.633 --> 00:19.867
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.867 --> 00:21.867
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:21.867 --> 00:23.933
- * ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.933 --> 00:25.600
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:25.600 --> 00:27.933
- * IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
- * 如果是航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:27.933 --> 00:29.433
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:29.433 --> 00:31.900
- * THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
- * 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:31.900 --> 00:33.833
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.833 --> 00:35.867
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:35.867 --> 00:37.800
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.800 --> 00:39.767
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.767 --> 00:41.000
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.000 --> 00:43.300
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:43.300 --> 00:45.767
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.767 --> 00:48.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:48.067 --> 00:49.500
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.233 --> 00:55.233
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

00:55.233 --> 01:03.300
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:03.300 --> 01:07.400
- [snoring, muttering]
- [打鼾，嘀咕]

01:12.967 --> 01:14.133
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

01:14.133 --> 01:16.600
[ding]
[叮]

01:24.400 --> 01:27.067
OOH-WAH!
噢哇！

01:28.833 --> 01:32.400
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

01:53.900 --> 01:55.867
OH!
哦！

01:57.467 --> 02:02.067
- HMM? WHO'S THAT?
- 唔？那是谁？

02:02.067 --> 02:05.567
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

02:05.567 --> 02:06.867
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:06.867 --> 02:09.933
- [warbling cry]
- [颤声哭泣]

02:09.933 --> 02:17.867
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:20.267 --> 02:24.067
AH!
啊！

02:26.067 --> 02:29.200
[jet engine roars]
[喷气发动机轰鸣]

02:29.200 --> 02:31.500
[ding]
AH!
[叮]
啊！

02:31.500 --> 02:35.200
[spatula clatters,
knuckles cracking]
[锅铲叮当响，
指关节嘎吱作响]

02:35.200 --> 02:39.200
HMM, SOMETHING'S MISSING.
嗯，缺少一些东西。

02:41.900 --> 02:43.933
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:43.933 --> 02:46.267
AHA!
JUNE 15TH.
啊哈！
6 月 15 日。

02:48.933 --> 02:52.167
[slurps, chomping]
[啜饮，咀嚼]

02:52.167 --> 02:55.100
FINE MONTH FOR PICKLES.
泡菜的好月。

02:59.100 --> 03:00.367
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

03:00.367 --> 03:01.500
- ORDER'S UP!
- 订单已满！

03:01.500 --> 03:03.867
ONE PERFECT PATTY
ON A PRISTINE PLATE
一份完美的肉饼
在原始的盘子上

03:03.867 --> 03:06.300
IN A SQUEAKY-CLEAN
KRUSTY KRAB.
干净整洁
脆皮蟹。

03:06.300 --> 03:10.167
MAN, OH, MAN,
DO I LOVE MY JOB!
伙计，哦，伙计，
我爱我的工作吗？

03:10.167 --> 03:12.067
HEY, MR. KRABS.
WHAT'S THE GOOD WORD?
嘿，先生。螃蟹。
什么是好词？

03:12.067 --> 03:13.400
- WELL, ACTUALLY, SPONGEBOB,
- 嗯，实际上，海绵宝宝，

03:13.400 --> 03:15.867
UH, THERE'S TWO WORDS.
呃，有两个词。

03:15.867 --> 03:17.900
AND THEY'RE NOT VERY GOOD.
而且它们不是很好。

03:17.900 --> 03:19.100
YOU'RE FIRED.
你被解雇了。

03:19.100 --> 03:22.067
[chuckles] WHAT?
- FIRED?
[笑]什么？
- 被解雇？

03:22.067 --> 03:23.533
- WELL, YOU SEE,
- 嗯，你看，

03:23.533 --> 03:25.200
I'VE BEEN DOIN'
SOME CALCULATIN'
我一直在做
一些计算

03:25.200 --> 03:27.967
AND, YOU KNOW, CRUNCHING
THE OLD NUMBERS.
而且，你知道，咀嚼
旧的数字。

03:27.967 --> 03:30.933
AND IT TURNS OUT
THAT I'LL SAVE A WHOLE NICKEL
事实证明
我会节省一整块镍币

03:30.933 --> 03:33.067
IF I CUT YOUR SALARY.
如果我削减你的薪水。

03:33.067 --> 03:34.300
COMPLETELY.
完全地。

03:34.300 --> 03:37.067
- [stammers] BUT HOW
ABOUT IF I WORK FOR FREE?
- [结巴]但是怎么办
关于我是否免费工作？

03:37.067 --> 03:38.833
- YEAH, I LOOKED
INTO THAT.
- 是的，我看了
进入那个。

03:38.833 --> 03:41.633
APPARENTLY, IT'S "ILLEGAL."
显然，这是“非法的”。

03:41.633 --> 03:44.067
AND I'LL LOSE
MY "VENDOR'S LICENSE."
我会输
我的“供应商许可证”。

03:44.067 --> 03:45.633
BLAH, BLAH, BLAH,
BLAH, BLAH.
巴拉，巴拉，巴拉，
巴拉，巴拉。

03:45.633 --> 03:46.933
- UH, 'SCUSE ME.
- 呃，对不起我。

03:46.933 --> 03:48.933
IS THAT MINE?
- I DON'T KNOW.
那是我的吗？
- 我不知道。

03:48.933 --> 03:50.333
MAYBE.
或许。

03:50.333 --> 03:51.400
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

03:51.400 --> 03:53.100
TAKE IT.
接受它。

03:53.100 --> 03:54.967
- YOU KNOW I LOVE YOU
LIKE A SON.
- 你知道我爱你
像儿子一样。

03:54.967 --> 03:57.600
BUT YOU CAN'T ARGUE
WITH A NICKEL.
但你不能争论
含镍。

03:57.600 --> 03:59.200
- BUT--BUT--BUT--BUT--
-但是--但是--但是--但是--

03:59.200 --> 04:00.700
BUT--BUT--BUT--BUT--
但是——但是——但是——但是——

04:00.700 --> 04:01.700
BUT--BUT--
BUT--BUT--
但是——但是——
但是——但是——

04:01.700 --> 04:02.933
BUT--BUT--BUT--BUT--
BUT--BUT--
但是——但是——但是——但是——
但是——但是——

04:02.933 --> 04:03.933
- HEY, WHAT ABOUT ME?
- 嘿，那我呢？

04:03.933 --> 04:05.067
CAN I GET FIRED TOO?
我也可以被解雇吗？

04:05.067 --> 04:06.700
- I'M AFRAID NOT, SQUIDWARD.
- 恐怕不是，章鱼哥。

04:06.700 --> 04:08.867
YOU'VE GOT SENIORITY.
- OH, YEAH.
你很有资历。
- 哦，是的。

04:08.867 --> 04:10.767
- NOPE, IT'S GOTTA BE YOU, SON.
- 不，一定是你，儿子。

04:10.767 --> 04:12.333
YOU'RE CANNED.
你被罐头了。

04:12.333 --> 04:13.400
HERE'S YOUR PINK SLIP.
这是你的粉色便条。

04:13.400 --> 04:16.333
I'M GIVING YOU THE AX.
我要给你斧头了。

04:19.100 --> 04:20.367
[zipper zips]
[拉链拉链]

04:20.367 --> 04:22.067
YOU'RE FIRED.
你被解雇了。

04:22.067 --> 04:23.067
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:23.067 --> 04:25.167
[sobbing] NO!
NOT THAT!
[抽泣]不！
不是那样！

04:25.167 --> 04:27.133
ANYTHING BUT THAT!
除此以外什么都可以！

04:27.133 --> 04:31.567
- SO, UH, IF YOU COULD JUST
HAND OVER YOUR SPATULA.
- 那么，呃，如果你可以的话
交出你的抹刀。

04:31.567 --> 04:33.133
UM...
- [wailing]
嗯...
- [哀号]

04:33.133 --> 04:35.633
- I'LL JUST TAKE THAT.
- 我就接受这个。

04:35.633 --> 04:39.267
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:39.267 --> 04:41.833
- HERE, I'LL GET THAT
FOR YOU.
- 在这里，我会明白的
为了您。

04:41.833 --> 04:42.833
[wailing]
[哀号]

04:42.833 --> 04:45.667
- I'LL ALSO NEED THE HAT.
- 我还需要帽子。

04:45.667 --> 04:48.200
ALLOW ME.
请允许我。

04:48.200 --> 04:50.067
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

04:50.067 --> 04:52.233
- GO AHEAD, TAKE A MOMENT
TO COLLECT YOURSELF.
- 继续，花点时间
自行收集。

04:52.233 --> 04:54.667
LONG AS YOU NEED.
只要您需要。

04:54.667 --> 05:00.667
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

05:05.800 --> 05:08.733
- I'M NOT
A VERY STRONG SWIMMER.
- 我不是
一个非常强壮的游泳运动员。

05:18.067 --> 05:19.500
- OKAY, THAT'S ENOUGH.
- 好吧，够了。

05:19.500 --> 05:21.300
IT'S CLOSING TIME.
关门时间到了。

05:21.300 --> 05:23.433
YOU KNOW,
IT JUST WON'T BE
你知道，
它只是不会

05:23.433 --> 05:25.400
THE SAME AROUND HERE
WITHOUT YOU.
这里也一样
没有你。

05:25.400 --> 05:28.767
YOU'LL HAVE TO VISIT SOMETIME...
AS A CUSTOMER.
您有时必须去参观...
作为客户。

05:30.400 --> 05:32.800
- [wails]
- [哀号]

05:32.800 --> 05:34.200
- BUH-BYE NOW.
- 现在再见。

05:34.200 --> 05:35.467
SAYONARA.
再见。

05:35.467 --> 05:38.133
GOOD RIDDANCE.
祝你摆脱困境。

05:38.133 --> 05:40.800
MAN, IS IT GONNA BE SWEET
WITHOUT THAT PEST AROUND!
伙计，会很甜吗
周围没有害虫！

05:40.800 --> 05:41.867
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

05:41.867 --> 05:43.700
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

05:43.700 --> 05:47.167
- THIS DAY COULDN'T GET
ANY BETTER.
- 这一天无法实现
更好一些。

05:47.167 --> 05:48.500
WELL, EUGENE,
嗯，尤金，

05:48.500 --> 05:51.167
LET ME COMMEND YOU
ON A TERRIFIC BUSINESS DECISION.
让我赞扬你
一个了不起的商业决策。

05:51.167 --> 05:54.133
BUT NOW THAT SPONGEBOB'S GONE,
WHO WILL BE RUNNING THE GRILL?
但现在海绵宝宝已经走了
谁来经营烧烤店？

05:54.133 --> 05:56.200
- SQUIDWARD,
I'LL HAVE YOU KNOW,
- 章鱼哥，
我会让你知道，

05:56.200 --> 05:59.133
I WAS FIVE TIMES
"GOLDEN SPATULA" IN THE NAVY,
我是五次
海军中的“金铲子”，

05:59.133 --> 06:00.933
SO I'LL BE RUNNIN' THE GRILL.
所以我会经营烧烤店。

06:00.933 --> 06:02.133
OOH!
哦！

06:02.133 --> 06:05.433
- I CAN SMELL
THE GREASE FIRES ALREADY.
- 我能闻到
油脂已经着火了。

06:08.833 --> 06:12.233
- HEY, GARY, I'M HOME.
- 嘿，加里，我回来了。

06:12.233 --> 06:14.367
FOREVER.
永远。

06:14.367 --> 06:17.167
[wailing]
[哀号]

06:17.167 --> 06:18.533
- [meowing]
- [喵喵叫]

06:18.533 --> 06:21.733
- OH, MR. KRABS FEELS
HE DOESN'T NEED ME ANYMORE.
- 哦，先生。蟹蟹的感觉
他不再需要我了。

06:21.733 --> 06:22.733
- [meows]
- [喵]

06:22.733 --> 06:24.233
- WHAT'S THAT, GARY?
- 那是什么，加里？

06:24.233 --> 06:25.667
YOU NEED ME?
你需要我吗？

06:25.667 --> 06:30.833
OH, THE UNCONDITIONAL LOVE
OF A PET.
哦，无条件的爱
宠物的。

06:30.833 --> 06:31.867
OH, I'M SORRY.
哦，对不起。

06:31.867 --> 06:34.167
HERE I AM WALLOWING
IN MY MISERY,
我在这里打滚
在我的痛苦中，

06:34.167 --> 06:37.167
AND IT'S PAST
YOUR DINNERTIME.
一切都过去了
您的晚餐时间。

06:37.167 --> 06:39.433
[sighs]
[叹气]

06:41.867 --> 06:45.233
I USED TO FEED EVERYONE
IN BIKINI BOTTOM.
我曾经养活每个人
比基尼下装。

06:45.233 --> 06:48.433
NOW I JUST FEED YOU.
现在我只喂你。

06:53.500 --> 06:54.533
OH, THANKS, GARY.
哦，谢谢，加里。

06:54.533 --> 06:57.233
- [meows]
- [喵]

06:57.233 --> 06:59.733
- THAT'S HOW
I USED TO HOLD MY SPATULA.
- 就是这样
我曾经拿着我的抹刀。

06:59.733 --> 07:04.733
[wails]
[哀号]

07:04.733 --> 07:07.733
- [distant sobbing]
- [远处的抽泣]

07:07.733 --> 07:13.267
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

07:13.267 --> 07:15.300
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

07:15.300 --> 07:16.333
- PATRICK, WHAT'S WRONG?
- 帕特里克，怎么了？

07:16.333 --> 07:18.200
- OH, HEY, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，嘿，海绵宝宝。

07:18.200 --> 07:21.600
I HEARD YOU CRYING,
AND IT MADE ME SAD.
我听到你哭了，
这让我很伤心。

07:21.600 --> 07:23.233
[stifled crying]
[强忍着哭声]

07:23.233 --> 07:24.700
- GEE, I'M SORRY.
- 哎呀，对不起。

07:24.700 --> 07:25.733
WHY DON'T YOU COME INSIDE?
你为什么不进来？

07:25.733 --> 07:27.800
- OKAY!
- 好的！

07:29.867 --> 07:31.267
HI, SPONGEBOB!
嗨，海绵宝宝！

07:31.267 --> 07:33.967
WHY ARE YOU MAKING ME
SO SAD?
你为什么要逼我
这么伤心吗？

07:33.967 --> 07:36.267
- PATRICK, THE MOST
HORRIBLE THING HAPPENED TODAY.
- 帕特里克，最
今天发生了可怕的事情。

07:36.267 --> 07:37.333
I GOT--
我得到了——

07:37.333 --> 07:40.600
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
F-F-F-F-F-F-F...

07:40.600 --> 07:41.767
- FREE FRENCH FRIES?
- 免费炸薯条？

07:41.767 --> 07:45.067
- F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...

07:45.067 --> 07:46.500
- FRIED FRITTATAS?
- 炸菜肉馅煎蛋饼？

07:46.500 --> 07:49.167
- F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F-F-F-F...

07:49.167 --> 07:51.067
- FROTHY FRAPPE?
- 泡沫冰沙？

07:51.067 --> 07:52.300
- F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F...
-F-F-F-F...

07:52.300 --> 07:53.900
- I CAN'T THINK
OF ANY MORE FOOD
- 我想不出来
更多食物

07:53.900 --> 07:56.100
THAT STARTS
WITH THE LETTER "C," SPONGEBOB.
就这样开始
带有字母“C”的海绵宝宝。

07:56.100 --> 07:58.367
- IT'S NOT FOOD, PATRICK.
- 这不是食物，帕特里克。

07:58.367 --> 08:00.467
I GOT FIRED.
我被解雇了。

08:00.467 --> 08:02.333
- HEY, THAT'S GREAT!
- 嘿，太棒了！

08:02.333 --> 08:05.233
BEING UNEMPLOYED
IS THE BEST GIG I KNOW!
失业
是我所知道的最好的演出！

08:05.233 --> 08:06.467
I TELL YOU WHAT.
我告诉你什么。

08:06.467 --> 08:08.700
MEET ME TOMORROW MORNING,
明天早上来见我，

08:08.700 --> 08:10.433
AND I'LL INTRODUCE YOU
我会介绍你

08:10.433 --> 08:13.633
TO THE WONDERS
OF THE UNEMPLOYED LIFESTYLE.
走向奇迹
失业者的生活方式。

08:13.633 --> 08:15.433
- SORRY, PATRICK, I CAN'T.
- 对不起，帕特里克，我不能。

08:15.433 --> 08:17.700
I HAVE TO WOR--
OH.
我必须工作——
哦。

08:17.700 --> 08:18.733
YEAH, OKAY.
是啊，好吧。

08:18.733 --> 08:19.733
- GREAT.
- 伟大的。

08:19.733 --> 08:21.067
SEE YOU THEN.
到时候见。

08:21.067 --> 08:24.067
[grunts]
- [sighs]
[咕哝]
- [叹气]

08:26.200 --> 08:31.600
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

08:36.433 --> 08:38.133
[lock clanking, hinge creaks]
[锁叮当作响，铰链吱吱作响]

08:38.133 --> 08:39.133
OH!
哦！

08:39.133 --> 08:42.767
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

08:42.767 --> 08:43.800
HEY, BUDDY!
嘿，伙计！

08:43.800 --> 08:45.067
ARE YOU READY?
你准备好了吗？

08:45.067 --> 08:48.933
READY FOR YOUR FIRST DAY
OF GLORIOUS UNEMPLOYMENT?
为您的第一天做好准备
光荣的失业？

08:48.933 --> 08:51.533
OR AS I LIKE
TO CALL IT,
或者随我喜欢
调用它，

08:51.533 --> 08:55.067
"FUN-EMPLOYMENT"!
“有趣的工作”！

08:55.067 --> 08:56.067
- YEAH, SURE.
- 是的，当然。

08:56.067 --> 08:57.100
[slurps]
[啜饮]

08:57.100 --> 08:58.400
WHATEVER.
任何。

08:58.400 --> 09:01.067
- THAT'S THE SPIRIT!
- 这就是精神！

09:01.067 --> 09:05.900
NOW, THE FIRST STOP
ON OUR TOUR OF FUN-EMPLOYMENT
现在，第一站
踏上有趣的工作之旅

09:05.900 --> 09:10.333
IS A HEALTHY BREAKFAST WITH
OUR GOOD FRIEND MR. SQUIDWARD.
是一顿健康的早餐
我们的好朋友先生。章鱼哥。

09:10.333 --> 09:11.633
HEY, SQUIDWARD!
嘿，章鱼哥！

09:11.633 --> 09:14.233
HOW ARE YOU
THIS FINE MORNING?
你好吗
今天早上好吗？

09:14.233 --> 09:16.067
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

09:16.067 --> 09:19.067
HOW MANY TIMES
DO I HAVE TO TELL YOU...
多少次
我必须告诉你吗...

09:19.067 --> 09:20.067
KEEP...
[grunts]
保持...
[咕哝]

09:20.067 --> 09:21.067
OFF...
[grunts]
关闭...
[咕哝]

09:21.067 --> 09:22.067
MY...
[grunts]
我的...
[咕哝]

09:22.067 --> 09:25.900
PETUNIAS!
佩妮娅！

09:25.900 --> 09:29.433
- [gobbles]
- [狼吞虎咽]

09:29.433 --> 09:30.600
[gulps]
[吞咽]

09:30.600 --> 09:32.867
I'LL JUST SAVE
THIS FOR LATER.
我会保存
稍后再说。

09:32.867 --> 09:34.400
NOW YOU TRY.
现在你试试。

09:34.400 --> 09:36.600
- UH...
- 呃...

09:36.600 --> 09:37.733
[slurps]
[啜饮]

09:37.733 --> 09:39.767
- [laughs]
- HEY, SQUIDWARD.
- [笑]
- 嘿，章鱼哥。

09:39.767 --> 09:43.067
LOOK AT ME.
I'M FUN-EMPLOYED!
看着我。
我工作很有趣！

09:43.067 --> 09:44.833
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

09:44.833 --> 09:48.167
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

09:48.167 --> 09:49.567
- [slurps]
- [啜饮]

09:49.567 --> 09:52.067
- HEY, YOU'RE GOOD
AT THIS.
- 嘿，你很好
在此。

09:52.067 --> 09:55.067
NEXT ON OUR ITINERARY,
接下来我们的行程，

09:55.067 --> 09:57.900
A BRIEF MID-MORNING SIESTA.
上午短暂的午睡。

09:57.900 --> 10:01.067
[humming]
[grunts]
[嗡嗡声]
[咕哝]

10:01.067 --> 10:07.000
[snoring]
[打鼾]

10:15.300 --> 10:16.367
- [meows]
- [喵]

10:19.033 --> 10:20.767
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

10:20.767 --> 10:24.233
[groaning]
[呻吟]

10:30.133 --> 10:32.300
[gulps]
[吞咽]

10:32.300 --> 10:33.633
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

10:33.633 --> 10:36.000
ARE YOU FEELING
ANY BETTER YET?
你有什么感觉吗
还有更好的吗？

10:36.000 --> 10:37.967
- [slurps]
UH-UH.
- [啜饮]
呃-呃。

10:37.967 --> 10:40.033
- COME ON, SADPANTS.
- 来吧，悲伤的人。

10:40.033 --> 10:42.800
YOU KNOW
WHAT ALWAYS PICKS ME UP?
你知道
什么总是让我振作起来？

10:42.800 --> 10:44.100
- NOPE.
- 没有。

10:44.100 --> 10:46.733
- FREE LUNCH WITH FRIENDS!
- 与朋友一起享用免费午餐！

10:46.733 --> 10:50.667
- YIPPEE.
- 耶皮。

10:50.667 --> 10:55.467
- OKAY, LET'S BEGIN
THE EXPERIMENT.
- 好吧，我们开始吧
实验。

10:55.467 --> 10:57.300
- [gobbling]
- [狼吞虎咽]

10:57.300 --> 10:59.800
HUH?
嗯？

10:59.800 --> 11:02.067
- MM-HMM.
- 嗯嗯。

11:04.100 --> 11:05.900
OKAY, NEXT.
好的，下一个。

11:05.900 --> 11:09.333
- OH, BOY, LUNCH!
- 哦，男孩，午餐！

11:09.333 --> 11:10.500
[gobbling]
[狼吞虎咽]

11:10.500 --> 11:11.500
[gulps]
[吞咽]

11:11.500 --> 11:13.300
AHH.
啊啊。

11:13.300 --> 11:15.333
[groaning]
[呻吟]

11:15.333 --> 11:17.633
- MORE! MORE!
- 更多的！更多的！

11:17.633 --> 11:21.600
- VERY INTERESTING.
OKAY, NEXT.
- 非常有趣。
好的，下一个。

11:21.600 --> 11:23.833
SPONGEBOB!
I ALMOST DIDN'T RECOGNIZE YOU.
海绵宝宝！
我差点没认出你来。

11:23.833 --> 11:26.067
YOU LOOK AWFUL!
- [groaning]
你看起来很糟糕！
- [呻吟]

11:26.067 --> 11:28.333
- WHAT ARE YOU DOIN'
WITH THESE HERE FREELOADERS?
- 你在做什么
这里有这些免费的人吗？

11:28.333 --> 11:29.933
- I GOT FIRED.
- 我被解雇了。

11:29.933 --> 11:34.733
NOW I'M FUN-EMPLOYED.
WHOO-HOO.
现在我的工作很有趣。
呼呼。

11:34.733 --> 11:37.067
- WHOA, THERE.
YOU DO NOT WANT TO EAT THAT.
- 哇，那里。
你不想吃那个。

11:37.067 --> 11:39.467
- WHY? WHAT IS IT?
- HECK IF I KNOW.
- 为什么？它是什么？
- 如果我知道的话就见鬼了。

11:39.467 --> 11:41.567
[whispers] THIS HERE'S
A PSYCHOLOGICAL TEST TO SEE
[低声]这是这里
一项值得一看的心理测试

11:41.567 --> 11:43.600
HOW MUCH WEIRD GUNK
FOLKS WILL EAT...
有多少奇怪的东西
老百姓会吃...

11:43.600 --> 11:48.967
IF IT'S FREE.
如果它是免费的。

11:48.967 --> 11:50.133
WHO'S FOR SECONDS?
谁适合几秒钟？

11:50.133 --> 11:53.567
both: ME!
两人：我！

11:53.567 --> 11:56.067
- HERE YA GO,
LITTLE BUDDY.
- 来吧，
小伙伴。

11:56.067 --> 11:59.533
- [gobbling]
- [狼吞虎咽]

11:59.533 --> 12:02.067
- AHH.
MMM!
-啊啊。
嗯！

12:02.067 --> 12:03.400
- SPONGEBOB,
YOU'RE A MESS.
- 海绵宝宝，
你一团糟。

12:03.400 --> 12:06.933
YOU'RE FALLING APART.
你已经崩溃了。

12:06.933 --> 12:08.533
COME ON NOW, SPONGEBOB.
来吧，海绵宝宝。

12:08.533 --> 12:10.200
YOU NEED TO PULL
YOURSELF TOGETHER.
你需要拉
你们自己在一起。

12:10.200 --> 12:12.133
GET SOME STRUCTURE
IN YOUR LIFE.
获得一些结构
在你的生活中。

12:12.133 --> 12:14.900
WHAT YOU NEED
IS A NEW JOB.
您需要什么
是一份新工作。

12:14.900 --> 12:16.800
- YOU'RE RIGHT, SANDY.
- 你是对的，桑迪。

12:16.800 --> 12:20.267
I'M AFRAID I CAN'T
DO THIS ANYMORE, PATRICK.
恐怕我不能
帕特里克，再做一次。

12:20.267 --> 12:22.167
UNEMPLOYMENT MAY
BE FUN FOR YOU,
失业可能
为你带来乐趣，

12:22.167 --> 12:23.733
BUT I NEED
TO GET A JOB.
但我需要
为了找到工作。

12:23.733 --> 12:25.933
- WHO DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE FOOLING, YOU LOSER?
- 你认为谁
你在愚弄，你是失败者吗？

12:25.933 --> 12:28.067
YOU COULDN'T KEEP
A JOB IF YOU TRIED!
你无法保留
如果您尝试过，就会找到工作！

12:28.067 --> 12:30.733
- HEY! YOU CAN'T TALK
TO MY FRIEND LIKE THAT!
- 嘿！你不能说话
对我的朋友就是这样！

12:30.733 --> 12:32.800
UNH!
- [groans]
呃！
- [呻吟]

12:32.800 --> 12:34.967
- DON'T LISTEN TO HIM,
SPONGEBOB.
- 别听他的
海绵宝宝。

12:34.967 --> 12:36.567
YOU NEED TO FOLLOW
YOUR HEART.
你需要遵循
你的心。

12:36.567 --> 12:37.800
- THANKS, PATRICK.
- 谢谢，帕特里克。

12:37.800 --> 12:39.867
IT'S TIME
TO REJOIN THE WORKFORCE.
是时候了
重新加入劳动力队伍。

12:39.867 --> 12:42.700
GAINFUL EMPLOYMENT,
HERE I COME!
有酬就业，
我来了！

12:42.700 --> 12:46.667
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

12:46.667 --> 12:48.900
YAH!
啊！

12:48.900 --> 12:52.400
I'M READY!
WHOO-HOO!
我准备好了！
呼呼！

12:52.400 --> 12:54.667
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

12:54.667 --> 12:56.400
* I'M READY, I'M READY *
*我准备好了，我准备好了*

12:56.400 --> 12:58.133
* FOR A NEW JOB,
FOR A NEW JOB *
* 对于新工作，
寻找新工作 *

12:58.133 --> 13:00.667
* I'M READY FOR A NEW JOB,
I'M READY *
* 我已准备好接受新工作，
我准备好了 *

13:00.667 --> 13:04.533
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

13:04.533 --> 13:07.467
GREETINGS, PURVEYOR
OF ELONGATED SAUSAGE PRODUCTS!
您好，供应商
细长香肠产品！

13:07.467 --> 13:09.533
I WOULD LOVE TO WORK
AT YOUR ESTABLISHMENT.
我愿意工作
在您的机构。

13:09.533 --> 13:13.300
- WELL, YOU DO
LOOK ENTHUSIASTIC.
- 嗯，你会的
看起来很热情。

13:13.300 --> 13:15.767
HMM.
ALL RIGHT, KID.
唔。
好吧，孩子。

13:15.767 --> 13:17.967
LET'S SEE WHAT YOU GOT.
让我们看看你得到了什么。

13:17.967 --> 13:21.067
SO THIS IS THE KITCHEN.
这就是厨房。

13:21.067 --> 13:24.367
- HMM.
- 唔。

13:24.367 --> 13:26.367
THIS GRILL IS NOT
IN VERY GOOD SHAPE.
这个烧烤架不是
状态非常好。

13:26.367 --> 13:28.700
- OH, WE DON'T
USE THE GRILL.
- 哦，我们不
使用烤架。

13:28.700 --> 13:32.133
WE COOK EVERYTHING
ON THE ROLLER.
我们什么都煮
在滚轴上。

13:32.133 --> 13:33.300
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

13:33.300 --> 13:35.867
- GOOD LUCK, KID.
- 祝你好运，孩子。

13:37.100 --> 13:39.300
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

13:44.967 --> 13:48.267
- HMM. THERE'S SOMETHING NOT
QUITE RIGHT ABOUT THIS FOOD,
- 唔。有什么东西不存在
关于这种食物非常正确，

13:48.267 --> 13:51.100
BUT I'M NOT SURE
WHAT IT IS.
但我不确定
它是什么。

13:51.100 --> 13:53.700
AHA!
啊哈！

14:05.200 --> 14:06.867
[gulps, burps]
[吞咽，打嗝]

14:06.867 --> 14:09.067
HEY!
WHERE ARE THOSE WEENIES?
嘿！
那些小家伙在哪里？

14:09.067 --> 14:10.900
[grunts]
[咕哝]

14:10.900 --> 14:13.800
- YOUR WEENIES, SIR.
- 你的威尼，先生。

14:13.800 --> 14:14.933
- WHAT IN THE NAME
- 名字是什么

14:14.933 --> 14:17.067
OF DAVY JONES' GYM SHORTS
ARE THESE?
DAVY Jones 的健身短裤
这些是吗？

14:17.067 --> 14:18.500
- THEY'RE WEENIE PATTIES.
- 它们是威尼馅饼。

14:18.500 --> 14:21.167
- WHAT ARE YOU,
SOME KIND OF NUT?
- 你是什么，
某种坚果？

14:21.167 --> 14:24.067
YOU'VE RUINED MY WEENIES!
YOU'RE FIRED!
你毁了我的小宝贝！
你被解雇了！

14:24.067 --> 14:27.633
- AAH!
BUT, MR. KRABS, WHY?
- 啊啊！
但是，先生。螃蟹，为什么？

14:27.633 --> 14:28.767
- MR. WHO?
- 先生。 WHO？

14:28.767 --> 14:30.300
- I MEAN, MR. WEINER!
- 我的意思是，先生。韦纳！

14:30.300 --> 14:33.067
- JUST GO.
- 走吧。

14:33.067 --> 14:35.933
- WELL,
THAT WAS A SETBACK.
- 嗯，
这是一个挫折。

14:37.100 --> 14:39.167
HELLO, PIZZA PIEHOLE!
你好，披萨饼！

14:42.367 --> 14:44.100
EXCUSE ME,
MR. PIZZA MAN.
对不起，
先生。披萨男。

14:44.100 --> 14:46.333
YOU NEED A FRY-COOK?
您需要炒菜吗？

14:46.333 --> 14:48.733
- OH, BOY, DO I!
CAN YOU MAKE PIZZA?
- 哦，天哪，我愿意！
你会做披萨吗？

14:48.733 --> 14:51.667
- EH...PROBABLY.
- 呃...也许吧。

14:54.900 --> 14:58.100
- OH, THAT'S AMAZING.
CONGRATULATIONS, YOU'RE HIRED.
- 哦，太棒了。
恭喜，您被录用了。

14:58.100 --> 15:00.133
- COOL.
- 凉爽的。

15:03.300 --> 15:06.167
WELL, IT'S NO KRABBY PATTY,
BUT...
嗯，这不是蟹肉饼，
但是...

15:06.167 --> 15:08.267
PERHAPS
I'LL FIND CONTENTMENT.
也许
我会找到满足的。

15:08.267 --> 15:10.067
- HEY, BUDDY,
HOW'S THE PIZZA COMING?
- 嘿，伙计，
披萨怎么样了？

15:10.067 --> 15:11.167
- ALMOST DONE!
- 快完成了！

15:11.167 --> 15:13.067
BUT I DID CHANGE
THE RECIPE A BIT.
但我确实改变了
食谱一点。

15:13.067 --> 15:14.833
- [laughs]
NO PROBLEM.
- [笑]
没问题。

15:14.833 --> 15:15.933
[bell dings]
[铃声]

15:15.933 --> 15:17.633
A FEW EXTRA TOPPINGS
NEVER HURT ANYONE.
一些额外的配料
永远不要伤害任何人。

15:17.633 --> 15:20.100
HUH?
WHAT HAVE YOU DONE?
嗯？
你做了什么？

15:20.100 --> 15:22.767
YOU'VE TURNED
AN INNOCENT PIZZA INTO...
你已经转身
一份无辜的披萨...

15:22.767 --> 15:24.467
A PIZZA PATTY!
披萨饼！

15:24.467 --> 15:26.233
IT'S AN ABOMINATION!
这是令人憎恶的！

15:26.233 --> 15:28.333
- YEAH, OF DELICIOUSNESS!
- 是啊，美味！

15:28.333 --> 15:29.533
- YOU'RE FIRED!
- 你被解雇了！

15:29.533 --> 15:31.700
- BUT WHO'LL MAKE
THE KRABBY PATTIES?
- 但谁会做
蟹肉饼？

15:31.700 --> 15:32.867
- KRABBY PATTIES?
- 蟹黄馅饼？

15:32.867 --> 15:35.867
WHAT DO YOU THINK THIS IS,
THE KRUSTY KRAB?
你认为这是什么，
脆皮蟹？

15:40.267 --> 15:42.833
- LIKE I NEED HIS DUMB JOB,
ANYWAY.
- 就像我需要他的愚蠢工作一样
无论如何。

15:42.833 --> 15:45.933
I HOPE HIS PEPPERONI
FALLS OFF.
我希望他的意大利辣香肠
脱落。

15:49.167 --> 15:51.900
HEY, TACO MAN,
MAY I HAVE A JOB, POR FAVOR?
嘿，玉米饼人，
请问我可以找份工作吗？

15:51.900 --> 15:54.067
- HMM.
ALL RIGHT.
- 唔。
好的。

15:54.067 --> 15:57.567
LET'S SEE WHAT YOU CAN DO
WITH A BURRITO.
让我们看看你能做什么
配墨西哥卷饼。

15:59.367 --> 16:03.067
[sizzling, clatter]
[嘶嘶声，咔哒声]

16:03.067 --> 16:04.700
- HOW ABOUT THAT?
- 怎么样？

16:04.700 --> 16:06.600
- INTERESTING.
- 有趣的。

16:06.600 --> 16:08.567
IT'S SOME SORT
OF BURRITO PATTY.
这是某种
墨西哥卷饼馅饼。

16:08.567 --> 16:09.567
HMM.
唔。

16:09.567 --> 16:11.167
WHO'D LIKE
TO TASTE IT?
谁想要
想尝尝吗？

16:11.167 --> 16:15.533
- I'LL GIVE IT A GO!
- 我会尝试一下！

16:15.533 --> 16:17.067
- YOU'RE FIRED!
- 你被解雇了！

16:17.067 --> 16:19.633
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

16:19.633 --> 16:22.833
BUT I'VE GIVEN YOU THE BEST
YEARS OF MY LIFE, MR. KRABS!
但我已经给了你最好的
我生命中的岁月，先生。螃蟹！

16:22.833 --> 16:24.067
[cries]
[哭声]

16:24.067 --> 16:25.567
- GET TO STEPPIN'!
- 开始吧！

16:25.567 --> 16:31.933
- [wailing]
- [哀号]

16:34.100 --> 16:36.833
[crashing]
[崩溃]

16:36.833 --> 16:40.067
- YOU'RE FIRED!
- AAH!
- 你被解雇了！
- 啊啊！

16:40.067 --> 16:43.433
- AND TAKE YOUR NOODLE PATTY
WITH YOU!
- 带上你的面条饼
与您同在！

16:43.433 --> 16:45.100
- OH, I'LL TAKE IT,
ALL RIGHT.
- 哦，我会接受的，
好吧。

16:45.100 --> 16:47.400
I'LL TAKE IT TO GO!
我会把它带走！

16:47.400 --> 16:49.867
HOME.
家。

16:49.867 --> 16:51.267
[sighs]
[叹气]

16:51.267 --> 16:53.267
FOR YEARS I WORKED
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
我工作多年
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅。

16:53.267 --> 16:56.900
NOW I'VE BEEN FIRED
FIVE TIMES IN ONE DAY.
现在我被解雇了
一天五次。

16:56.900 --> 16:59.667
WHO ARE YOU GONNA
COOK FOR NOW, SPONGEBOB?
你要是谁
现在做饭吧，海绵宝宝？

16:59.667 --> 17:00.867
- [meows]
- [喵]

17:00.867 --> 17:02.967
- SORRY, GARY,
YOU MUST BE STARVING.
- 对不起，加里，
你一定饿坏了。

17:02.967 --> 17:04.633
DON'T WORRY, GARE-BEAR.
别担心，小熊。

17:04.633 --> 17:07.067
I'LL OPEN UP A CAN
OF SNAILPO FOR YOU.
我要打开一个罐头
SNAILPO 为您服务。

17:07.067 --> 17:08.233
OH, NO.
哦，不。

17:08.233 --> 17:10.233
WE'RE ALL OUT OF SNAILPO.
我们都离开了 SNAILPO。

17:10.233 --> 17:11.633
WE'LL JUST HAVE
TO MAKE OUR OWN.
我们只要有
打造我们自己的。

17:11.633 --> 17:14.633
[tropical music]
[热带音乐]

17:14.633 --> 17:21.533
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

17:21.533 --> 17:25.533
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

17:25.533 --> 17:27.633
[boiling]
[沸腾]

17:29.833 --> 17:31.767
PERFECT!
完美的！

17:48.533 --> 17:51.533
ONE HOMEMADE CAN
OF SNAILPO!
一罐自制罐头
蜗牛！

17:59.400 --> 18:00.567
- [meows]
- [喵]

18:00.567 --> 18:01.767
- WHAT'S THAT, GARY?
- 那是什么，加里？

18:01.767 --> 18:03.067
IT'S THE BEST FOOD
YOU'VE EVER HAD?
这是最好的食物
你有过吗？

18:03.067 --> 18:04.700
- [meows]
- [喵]

18:04.700 --> 18:06.800
- [gobbling]
- [狼吞虎咽]

18:06.800 --> 18:09.233
YEAH,
THIS IS DEE-LICIOUS!
是的，
这真是太美味了！

18:09.233 --> 18:11.633
DOES IT HAVE
ANY SIDE EFFECTS?
有吗
有副作用吗？

18:11.633 --> 18:13.300
- ONLY SATISFACTION.
- 只有满意。

18:13.300 --> 18:14.700
[sighs]
[叹气]

18:14.700 --> 18:16.267
IF ONLY MY BOSSES
LIKED MY COOKING
如果只有我的老板
喜欢我的厨艺

18:16.267 --> 18:17.633
AS MUCH AS YOU TWO DO.
正如你们两个所做的那样。

18:17.633 --> 18:18.733
I MEAN, THREE.
我的意思是，三个。

18:18.733 --> 18:20.433
[knock on door]
[敲门]

18:20.433 --> 18:21.700
HELLO.
你好。

18:21.700 --> 18:22.900
HMM. THAT'S ODD.
唔。这很奇怪。

18:22.900 --> 18:25.100
I COULD'VE SWORN I HEARD
A KNOCK AT THE DOOR.
我可以发誓我听到了
有人敲门。

18:25.100 --> 18:27.133
[muffled yells]
[低声喊叫]

18:33.967 --> 18:35.400
MR. WEENIE?
先生。威妮？

18:35.400 --> 18:38.667
- CONGRATULATIONS, SPONGEBOB,
YOU'VE BEEN PROMOTED.
- 恭喜你，海绵宝宝，
你已经升职了。

18:38.667 --> 18:40.200
- BUT YOU JUST FIRED ME.
- 但你刚刚解雇了我。

18:40.200 --> 18:42.200
- THAT'S MUSTARD
UNDER THE BUN, MY BOY.
- 那是芥末
在发髻下，我的孩子。

18:42.200 --> 18:43.567
THE IMPORTANT THING IS,
重要的是，

18:43.567 --> 18:46.067
MY CUSTOMERS LOVE
YOUR LITTLE SLIDERS.
我的客户喜欢
你的小滑块。

18:46.067 --> 18:48.333
NOW GET TO WORK!
现在开始工作吧！

18:48.333 --> 18:50.867
- I'M PRETTY SURE
THIS IS ILLEGAL.
- 我很确定
这是非法的。

18:50.867 --> 18:52.633
WHAT AM I GONNA DO NOW?
我现在要做什么？

18:52.633 --> 18:54.067
- PSST!
- 嘘！

18:54.067 --> 18:56.200
HEY, KID.
YOU NEED HELP OUTTA HERE?
嘿，孩子。
您需要离开这里的帮助吗？

18:56.200 --> 18:58.233
- PIZZA PETE!
YES, PLEASE.
- 披萨皮特！
是的，请。

18:58.233 --> 19:00.300
THAT WEINER HAS ME
CHAINED TO THE GRILL,
那个韦纳有我
拴在烤架上，

19:00.300 --> 19:02.200
AND HE REALLY SEEMS
TO BE RELISHING IT.
他确实看起来
享受它。

19:02.200 --> 19:04.367
- I HAVE SOMETHING
TO FREE YOU.
- 我有东西
让你自由。

19:04.367 --> 19:06.067
- PIZZA SAUCE?
- 披萨酱？

19:12.533 --> 19:13.900
I'M FREE!
我有空了！

19:13.900 --> 19:16.133
- GREAT!
NOW YOU CAN GET TO MY GRILL.
- 伟大的！
现在你可以去我的烧烤店了。

19:16.133 --> 19:19.067
- WHAT?
- 什么？

19:19.067 --> 19:20.067
[gasps]
[喘气]

19:20.067 --> 19:22.933
PARMESAN-CRUSTED BREADSTICK!
帕尔马干酪皮面包棒！

19:22.933 --> 19:24.167
WHOA!
哇啊！

19:24.167 --> 19:26.733
- HEY! WHERE ARE YOU GOING
WITH MY FRY-COOK?
- 嘿！你要去哪里
用我的炒菜？

19:26.733 --> 19:29.167
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

19:29.167 --> 19:30.933
[screams]
[尖叫声]

19:30.933 --> 19:32.700
- [laughs]
- [笑]

19:32.700 --> 19:35.767
I'LL TAKE
ONE FRY-COOK TO GO!
我会接受
一份炸菜即可带走！

19:37.833 --> 19:39.800
[laughs]
[笑]

19:41.067 --> 19:43.167
- OH, THANK YOU, SENOR TACO!
- 哦，谢谢你，塔科先生！

19:43.167 --> 19:45.433
OH, NO! NOT YOU TOO!
哦，不！你也不是！

19:45.433 --> 19:47.267
[screams]
all: GET HIM!
[尖叫声]
所有人：抓住他！

19:47.267 --> 19:50.433
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

19:50.433 --> 19:51.500
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

19:51.500 --> 19:53.367
WHOA!
哇啊！

19:53.367 --> 19:55.400
- LET GO!
- HE'S MINE!
- 松手！
- 他是我的！

19:55.400 --> 19:57.700
- I WAS HERE FIRST!
- NO, I WAS!
- 我先来的！
- 不，我是！

19:57.700 --> 20:00.833
- STOP!
UNHAND THAT SPONGE!
- 停止！
松开海绵！

20:06.633 --> 20:09.867
[gobbling]
[狼吞虎咽]

20:09.867 --> 20:12.067
[growls]
[咆哮]

20:14.800 --> 20:17.833
- IT'S A KILLER PATTY!
- 这是一个杀手肉饼！

20:17.833 --> 20:20.167
[groaning]
[呻吟]

20:23.433 --> 20:26.267
- HERE, TAKE HIM!
JUST DON'T HURT ME.
- 来，把他带走！
只是不要伤害我。

20:26.267 --> 20:28.467
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

20:28.467 --> 20:29.500
[sighs]
[叹气]

20:29.500 --> 20:30.900
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

20:30.900 --> 20:32.333
AAH!
啊啊！

20:32.333 --> 20:36.433
- KRABBY PATTY!
YOU SAVED ME!
- 蟹黄派！
你救了我！

20:36.433 --> 20:38.600
WELL,
HERE WE GO AGAIN.
嗯，
我们又来了。

20:48.400 --> 20:50.600
- UGH!
THIS PLACE IS TERRIBLE!
- 呃！
这个地方太糟糕了！

20:50.600 --> 20:54.433
- THE KRUSTY KRAB
HAS REALLY GONE DOWNHILL.
- 脆皮蟹
确实已经走下坡路了。

20:54.433 --> 20:57.000
- HOW CAN YOU SERVE THIS SLOP?
- 你如何提供这种污水？

20:57.000 --> 20:58.767
I'M NEVER EATING HERE AGAIN!
我再也不会在这里吃饭了！

20:58.767 --> 21:03.067
- WAIT! COME BACK!
THAT WAS ME LAST CUSTOMER.
- 等待！回来！
那是我最后一个顾客。

21:03.067 --> 21:06.600
SPONGEBOB?
SQUIDWARD, YOU FOUND HIM!
海绵宝宝？
章鱼哥，你找到他了！

21:06.600 --> 21:09.733
- [gasps]
SQUIDWARD?
- [喘气]
章鱼哥？

21:09.733 --> 21:11.400
- I'M AFRAID SO.
- 我恐怕是这样。

21:11.400 --> 21:13.067
SPONGEBOB...
海绵宝宝...

21:13.067 --> 21:16.433
- YES, SQUIDWARD?
- YOU KNOW I HATE YOU, RIGHT?
- 是的，章鱼哥？
- 你知道我恨你，对吗？

21:16.433 --> 21:18.867
- YES.
YES, I DO.
- 是的。
是的，我愿意。

21:18.867 --> 21:20.700
- WELL, I HATE THE SMELL
- 嗯，我讨厌这种气味

21:20.700 --> 21:22.900
OF BURNING KRABBY PATTIES
EVEN MORE.
烧蟹肉饼
甚至更多。

21:22.900 --> 21:25.267
PLEASE COME BACK
AND BE THE FRY-COOK AGAIN.
请回来
再次成为炒菜厨师。

21:25.267 --> 21:28.500
- WELL, IF IT'S OKAY
WITH YOU, MR. KRABS.
- 好吧，如果可以的话
和你在一起，先生。螃蟹。

21:28.500 --> 21:31.600
- OH, LADDY,
I SHOULD'VE NEVER LET YOU GO.
- 哦，女士，
我不应该让你走。

21:31.600 --> 21:34.467
THE KRUSTY KRAB
HAS FALLEN APART WITHOUT YOU.
脆皮蟹
没有你就分崩离析了。

21:34.467 --> 21:36.433
YOU'RE REHIRED, BOY.
你被重新雇用了，孩子。

21:36.433 --> 21:38.933
- ALL RIGHT!
- 好的！

21:38.933 --> 21:42.067
NOW MY LIFE
HAS PURPOSE AGAIN!
现在我的生活
又有目标了！

21:42.067 --> 21:46.433
LET'S GET THIS PLACE
CLEANED UP.
让我们到达这个地方
清理干净了。

21:46.433 --> 21:49.267
[warbling cry]
[颤声哭泣]

22:07.533 --> 22:11.300
- HMM.
NOT EXACTLY MY COLOR.
- 唔。
不完全是我的颜色。

22:14.733 --> 22:18.067
- THE KRUSTY KRAB
IS BACK IN BUSINESS!
- 脆皮蟹
恢复营业了！

22:19.367 --> 22:21.233
[cheering]
[欢呼]

22:21.233 --> 22:24.233
[indistinct chatter]
[模糊的喋喋不休]

22:24.233 --> 22:27.533
- WELL, SPONGEBOB, IT LOOKS
LIKE THINGS ARE BACK TO NORMAL.
- 嗯，海绵宝宝，看起来
好像一切都恢复正常了。

22:27.533 --> 22:30.200
AND TO MAKE UP FOR
THAT EXTRA NICKEL I WAS LOSING,
并弥补
我失去的额外镍，

22:30.200 --> 22:32.167
I INSTALLED
A PAY TOILET.
我安装了
收费厕所。

22:32.167 --> 22:35.067
- OH, DEAR,
WHERE IS THAT NICKEL?
- 哦，亲爱的，
镍在哪里？

22:35.067 --> 22:38.333
[laughter]
[笑声]

22:38.333 --> 22:41.267
HUH?
WHY ARE YOU LAUGHING?
嗯？
你笑什么？

嗯？
你笑什么？